Third-party software
--------------------

The source code in this repository is original. The artifacts built from it
include third-party software, all of it under permissive licenses:

shipwick-agent and shipwick (Go binaries) are compiled together with the
modules listed in go.mod — Apache-2.0 (Moby, containerd, Cobra, OpenContainers,
OpenTelemetry and others), BSD-3-Clause (modernc.org/sqlite and its runtime,
golang.org/x/sys, golang.org/x/term, pflag) and MIT (go.yaml.in/yaml, go-winio,
go-isatty and others). `go mod download` followed by `go list -m all` gives the
exact versions; each module's license file is in its source tree.

The dashboard image is built from the packages listed in
dashboard/package-lock.json, which records the license of each. It bundles the
Geist and Geist Mono typefaces, Copyright 2024 The Geist Project Authors
(https://github.com/vercel/geist-font), licensed under the SIL Open Font
License, Version 1.1 (https://openfontlicense.org).
